

**25.4.36**: \(\int_{\circ}^{1}\frac{f(x)}{\sqrt{1-x}}\,dx{=}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(x_{i})}+R_{n}\)

Related orthogonal polynomials:

\[P_{2n}(\sqrt{1-x}),P_{2n}(1)=1\]

**Abscissas:** \(x_{i}{\equiv}1-{\xi}_{i}^{2}\) **where** \(\xi_{i}\) **is the** \(i^{\rm th}\) **positive zero of** \(P_{2n}(x)\)**.**

**Weights:** \(w_{i}{=}2w_{i}{{}^{(2n)}},w_{i}{{}^{(2n)}}\) **are the Gaussian weights of order** \(2n\)**.**

**Remainder:**

\[R_{n}{=}\frac{2^{4n+1}}{4n+1}\frac{[(2n)!]^{n}}{[(4n)!]^{n}}f^{{(2n)}}(\xi)\]

**Abscissas:**

\[\int_{-1}^{\circ}\frac{f(y)}{\sqrt{b-y}}dy{=}\sqrt{b-a}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(x_{i})}+R_{n}\]

**Weights:** \(w_{i}{=}4+(b-a)x_{i}\)

**Related orthogonal polynomials:**

\[P_{2n}(\sqrt{1-x}),P_{2n}(1)=1\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}1-{\xi}_{i}^{2}\]

**where** \(\xi_{i}\) **is the** \(i^{\rm th}\) **positive zero of** \(P_{2n}(x)\)**.**

**Weights:** \(w_{i}{=}2w_{i}{{}^{(2n)}},w_{i}{{}^{(2n)}}\) **are the Gaussian weights of order** \(2n\)**.**

**25.4.38**: \(\int_{-1}^{+1}\frac{f(x)}{\sqrt{1-x}}\,dx{=}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(x_{i})}+R_{n}\)

**Related orthogonal polynomials: Chebyshev Polynomials:**

\[T_{n}(x),T_{n}(1)=\frac{1}{2^{8-1}}\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}\cos\frac{(2i{-}1)\pi}{2n}\]

**Weights:**

\[w_{i}{=}\frac{\pi}{n}\]

**Remainder:**

\[R_{n}{=}\frac{\pi}{(2n)\mathbb{D}^{2n-1}}f^{{(2n)}}(\xi)\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}\cos\frac{(2i{-}1)\pi}{2n}\]

**Weights:**

\[w_{i}{=}\frac{\pi}{n}\]

**Releated orthogonal polynomials:**

\[T_{n}(x),T_{n}(1)=\frac{1}{2^{8-1}}\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}\cos\frac{(2i{-}1)\pi}{2n}\]

**Weights:**

\[w_{i}{=}\frac{\pi}{n}\]

**Abscissas:**

\[\int_{-1}^{+1}\!f(x)\,\sqrt{1-x^{2}}dx{=}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(x_{i})}+R_{n}\]

**Related orthogonal polynomials: Chebyshev Polynomials:**

\[T_{n}^{*}(x){=}\frac{\sin\,\left[(n{+}1)\;{\rm arccos}\;x\right]}{\sin\,\left[ \,\left({\rm arccos}\;x\right)\right]}\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}\cos\frac{(i{+}1)}{n{+}1}\,\pi\]

**Weights:**

\[w_{i}{=}\frac{\pi}{n{+}1}\sin^{2}\frac{(i{+}1)}{n{+}1}\,\pi\]

**Remainder:**

\[R_{n}{=}\frac{\pi}{(2n)\mathbb{D}^{2n+1}}f^{{(2n)}}(\xi)\]

**(\(-1{<}\xi{<}1\))**